  "description": {
   "en": "The darkness of vampires corrodes the entertainment industry. The light of \"the real thing\" tears through that darkness - the Animate Theater, located underground in Ikebukuro, Tokyo. Here, the first solo live performance of the idol group \"Banflame\", to which the main character, Tagiru Chishio, belongs, is being held. Tagiru is having his usual light-hearted chat, but something strange happens in the middle of the concert! \n\nShimamoto's first serialization in Weekly Shonen Sunday in 30 years."
  },
